# hermes-model-change-detector
owner: anser · cadence: real-time provider monitoring · status: SUGGESTED
**Want me to watch for unexpected model switches and alert you before they affect your work?**

## Prompt
When Hermes logs show active model changed to non-local provider (nous, openai, etc.) while user expected local turbofit, capture desktop preview, verify the switch is unintended, and report status with CLAIM badge on wiki page

## Evidence
> Hermes switched to meituan/longcat-2.0:free, stepfun/step-3.7-flash:free without user intent
> Chris explicitly wants Ornith via turbofit to stay active
